    /**
     * Stock Financial Statement
     *
     * Get company financial statement data based on report type and specific period.
     *
     * Income statement (IS) and cash flow (CF) periods are cumulative from the start of the fiscal year (year to date), as officially filed with IDX: Q1 = 3 months, Q2 = 6 months, Q3 = 9 months, FY = 12 months; values are not netted against the previous period. Balance sheet (BS) values are balances at period end.
     *
     * Response:
     * - columns: List of report periods from the latest, up to `limit` periods (default 8); null if there are no reports, each item contains:
     *   - label: Period label, e.g. "Q2 2025" or "FY 2024"
     *   - year: Fiscal year
     *   - period: Period code (FY, Q1, Q2, Q3, Q4)
     * - rows: Hierarchical list of statement accounts (BS/IS/CF per `statement`), ordered by `display_order`; accounts whose values are all 0 are omitted; null if no account has a value, each item contains:
     *   - id: Account ID (32-character string), used as the `account` parameter in financial-statement-chart
     *   - parent_id: Parent account ID; null for top-level accounts
     *   - name: Financial statement account name
     *   - is_abstract: true if the account is a heading/grouping, false if it is a value account
     *   - level: Account depth level in the hierarchy
     *   - display_order: Account display order
     *   - values: Account value per period, same order as `columns`, each item contains:
     *     - col: Period label, e.g. "Q2 2025" or "FY 2024"
     *     - year: Fiscal year
     *     - period: Period code (FY, Q1, Q2, Q3, Q4)
     *     - amount: Account value for that period including rolled-up sub-accounts (Rupiah)
     *
     * Update: Real-time according to each company's report
     *
     * Limited to data for the last 2 years
     * Initial Data: 2020-01-01 [ENTERPRISE]
     *
     * Route: `GET /analysis/financial-statement/{code}` — cached (`ttl`).
     *
     * @param string $code Kode saham emiten yang tercatat di BEI, mis. `BBCA`. Tidak case-sensitive. Daftar kode tersedia di `/analysis/list/stock`.
     * @param Statement|string $statement Jenis laporan keuangan: `BS` = neraca (balance sheet), `IS` = laba rugi (income statement), `CF` = arus kas (cash flow).
     * @param FinancialStatementType|string $type Periode laporan: `FY` = tahunan, `Q` = seluruh kuartal, `Q1`–`Q4` = kuartal tertentu.
     * @param int|null $limit Jumlah periode laporan terakhir yang ditampilkan. Default: `8`.
     * @return FinancialStatementResponse
     *
     * @throws InvezgoException On API, rate-limit or connection errors.
     * @see https://invezgo.com/id/analysis/finace/BBCA?statement=BS&type=Q&limit=10
     */
    public function getFinancialStatement(
